+        // boots the diorama FROM THE PARSED VALUES -- the exact bytes->parse->boot->stamp chain a real
+        // guest runs, minus only the socket. The marker is StartType = FIRST_ATTACK (1): NON-ZERO (a
+        // zeroed byte can't fake it -- BACK_ATTACK == 0) and NON-DEFAULT (Init seeds NORMAL == 2, and
+        // the F6 manual boot stamps NORMAL), so a dropped carry boots a visibly NORMAL battle and the
